Bundled AgentGuard runtime
==========================

This directory contains the AgentGuard Python client, shared rule runtime
(including the rule generator's DSLgeneration.md prompt), local skill modules,
the server backend (src/server/backend) and the default plugin configuration
(config/plugins.json), vendored from the AgentGuard research implementation.
The web frontend, examples, tests, generated files, and caches are excluded.

The bundled Python sources match the upstream AgentGuard checkout at
commit d1bdf0926c14f0454762f596e897e97198c2ea72. Project-specific
benchmark adaptation is kept outside this vendor directory.

